{"id":"f63fcc28a9b7afe5","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-relativization.md","title":"Relativizing Statement","display":"df-relativization — Relativizing Statement","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-relativization","aliases":["28-df-relativization","Relativizing Statement"],"display":"df-relativization — Relativizing Statement","depends_on":["[[28-df-oracle-class]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-relativization"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-relativization</span><span>Relativizing Statement</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-relativization — Relativizing Statement"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f4ae5e0b4d42d561\" href=\"?note=f4ae5e0b4d42d561\" title=\"28-df-oracle-class\">28-df-oracle-class</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>本原子位于元语言层。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi(\\mathcal C_1,\\ldots,\\mathcal C_m)\">\\(\\Phi(\\mathcal C_1,\\ldots,\\mathcal C_m)\\)</span> 是固定复杂性类命题模式；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi^B=\\Phi(\\mathcal C_1^B,\\ldots,\\mathcal C_m^B)\">\\(\\Phi^B=\\Phi(\\mathcal C_1^B,\\ldots,\\mathcal C_m^B)\\)</span> 为统一用同一语言预言机 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> 得到的模式实例。</li>\n<li>相对化类的已定义实例 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf P^B,\\mathbf{NP}^B\">\\(\\mathbf P^B,\\mathbf{NP}^B\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f4ae5e0b4d42d561\" href=\"?note=f4ae5e0b4d42d561\" title=\"28-df-oracle-class\">28-df-oracle-class</a>；涉及其他类时必须先给出它们的预言机版本。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Rel}(\\Phi)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall B\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^*\\;\\Phi^B.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Rel}(\\Phi)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall B\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^*\\;\\Phi^B.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>此谓词记录命题模式对所有预言机成立；“某一证明相对化”是对证明方法的更强元语言描述，不等同于该谓词本身。Baker–Gill–Solovay 定理表明 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf P=\\mathbf{NP}\">\\(\\mathbf P=\\mathbf{NP}\\)</span> 及其否定都不具备这里的全预言机有效性。</p>\n<p>来源核对：§3.4；印刷73–75页；PDF99–101页。已区分命题实例与证明方法。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-oracle-class","status":"resolved","id":"f4ae5e0b4d42d561","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-oracle-class]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-oracle-class","status":"resolved","id":"f4ae5e0b4d42d561","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"相对化类的已定义实例 $\\mathbf P^B,\\mathbf{NP}^B$ 见 [[28-df-oracle-class]]；涉及其他类时必须先给出它们的预言机版本。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Phi(\\mathcal C_1,\\ldots,\\mathcal C_m)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Phi^B=\\Phi(\\mathcal C_1^B,\\ldots,\\mathcal C_m^B)","display":false},{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf P^B,\\mathbf{NP}^B","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Rel}(\\Phi)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall B\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^*\\;\\Phi^B.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathbf P=\\mathbf{NP}","display":false}],"bytes":1245,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-76","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"预言机：[[28-df-oracle-tm]]、[[28-df-oracle-class]]、[[28-df-turing-reduction]]、[[28-df-relativization]]、[[28-thm-baker-gill-solovay]]。"},{"id":"7fa4b726f0a3069e","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathbf P$、$\\mathbf{NP}$ 分别见 [[28-df-p]]、[[28-df-np]]；$\\mathbf P^A$、$\\mathbf{NP}^A$ 见 [[28-df-oracle-class]]；元语言谓词 $\\operatorname{Rel}$ 见 [[28-df-relativization]]。"}],"outgoing":["f4ae5e0b4d42d561"]}